{"id":"de_sagre_able","lemma":"désagréable","pos":"adj","rank":3684,"glosses":["unpleasant; disagreeable"],"ipa":"/de.za.ɡʁe.abl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5c/Fr-d%C3%A9sagr%C3%A9able.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9sagr%C3%A9able.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"désagréables"},"formAudio":{"désagréables":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-d%C3%A9sagr%C3%A9ables.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu es désagréable.","en":"You're unpleasant.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Cela a un goût désagréable.","en":"It has an unpleasant taste.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"taste, flavour"},null]},{"text":"C'était un vieil homme désagréable.","en":"He was a disagreeable old man.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/29007","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"man"},null]},{"text":"Nous y avons eu une expérience désagréable.","en":"We had an unpleasant experience there.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"experience"},null]},{"text":"Le temps devient désagréable.","en":"The weather is turning nasty.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to become","l":"devenir"},null]}]}